# Date: 2017-03-07
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1087.002, attack.t1069.002, attack.s0039
# Description: Detects activity as "net user administrator /domain" and "net group domain admins /domain"
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(EventID equals "4661" AND AccessMask equals "0x2d" AND (ObjectType equals "SAM_USER" OR ObjectType equals "SAM_GROUP") AND ObjectName="S-1-5-21-*" AND (ObjectName="*-500" OR ObjectName="*-512"))
